### Services: Create (company) a QA service
POST {{base}}/api/services
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "scholarship",
  "title": "QA Scholarship {{ts}}",
  "slug": "qa-scholarship-{{ts}}",
  "description": "Scholarship created by REST tests",
  "organization": "QA Foundation",
  "companyId": {{companyId}},
  "country": "Afghanistan",
  "category": "QA",
  "tags": "scholarship,testing",
  "eligibility": "Undergrad",
  "applyUrl": "https://example.com/apply/{{ts}}",
  "status": "published"
}


### Services: Create (company) with documents (multipart)
POST {{base}}/api/services
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken} }
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

scholarship
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

QA Scholarship {{ts}}
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="slug"

qa-scholarship-{{ts}}
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Scholarship created by REST tests (multipart)
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="organization"

QA Foundation
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="companyId"

{{companyId}}
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="country"

Afghanistan
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

QA
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tags"

scholarship,testing
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="eligibility"

Undergrad
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="applyUrl"

https://example.com/apply/{{ts}}
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

published
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documents"; filename="cv.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf
Content-Transfer-Encoding: binary

< ./cv.pdf
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documents"; filename="coverletter.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf
Content-Transfer-Encoding: binary

< ./coverletter.pdf
--MyBoundary--

