Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Cleanup expired items before a date (live)
POST {{base}}/api/maintenance/cleanup-expired?before=2030-01-01T00:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Apply to the seeded Job (authenticated common) - multipart with file upload (uses repo PDFs)
