##############################
# Notifications
##############################

### Notifications: Admin create a test notification to specific user/company
POST {{base}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "System maintenance {{ts}}",
  "body": "We will perform maintenance tonight.",
  "link": "https://status.example.com",
  "targetAll": false,
  "recipientUserIds": [{{adminUserId}}],
  "recipientCompanyIds": [{{companyId}}]
}

### Notifications: Admin list
GET {{base}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Notifications: My Inbox (as company user)
GET {{base}}/api/notifications/me/inbox
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}

### Notifications: Mark one as read (replace 123 with a real recipient id from inbox)
POST {{base}}/api/notifications/me/123/read
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}

### Notifications: Admin broadcast to all users (common + company)
POST {{base}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Broadcast {{ts}}",
  "body": "Hello everyone!",
  "targetAll": true
}

### Notifications: My Inbox (common user)
GET {{base}}/api/notifications/me/inbox?unreadOnly=true

### Notifications: Mark all my notifications as read
POST {{base}}/api/notifications/me/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{commonToken}}

Authorization: Bearer {{commonToken}}

